* OctFunc inputs=A,B calls subtract(A, B) as two genuinely distinct positional arguments, never
* a bundled array -- A=10, B=3 gives 7, not -7 (which would indicate the arguments were swapped
* or bundled wrong). No title line.
A kind=const value=10
B kind=const value=3
G1 kind=octfunc path=doc-verify/octfunc/subtract.m function=subtract inputs=A,B
